<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 12:04:36 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a92cacfd8539</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这家新开的寿司店有这种葡萄苏打水，我超爱。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Person holding a clear bottle with blue cap and purple label, featuring grape illustrations and Japanese text." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmock/6a92cacfd8539.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmock.some.pics"&gt;@jmock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 12:04:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a92288c18858</link><description>&lt;p&gt;只有爪子&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="close-up of the horizontal front paws of a brown/black tabby cat, no toe beans shown" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/zannah/6a92288c18858.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://zannah.some.pics"&gt;@zannah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:32:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a92008a05f0c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;💃 赫米克瑟姆之声！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="💃 Hemiksem Klinkt! " height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a92008a05f0c.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:41:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a91e9dee5f61</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个火车站的弧形走廊，左侧是黄绿条纹瓷砖，右侧是布满涂鸦的砖墙，上方是黄色天花板，带有裸露横梁和照明灯具。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A curved hallway in a train station with yellow and green striped tiles on the left and brick walls with graffiti on the right, under a yellow ceiling with exposed beams and lighting. - Ein geschwungener Flur in einer S-Bahn-Station mit gelb-grün gestreiften Fliesen auf der linken Seite und Ziegelwänden mit Graffiti auf der rechten Seite, unter einer gelben Decke mit sichtbaren Balken und Beleuchtung." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6a91e9dee5f61.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:05:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a91e971cf3d7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;涂鸦覆盖的工业建筑横跨在火车轨道上方，天花板是黄色的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Graffiti covered industrial structure over train tracks with a yellow ceiling. - Graffiti-überdachte Industriestruktur über Bahngleisen mit gelber Decke." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6a91e971cf3d7.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:03:20 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>